            "jsonPointer": "/records/130"
          },
          "rationale": "Both complete cases actually explain fixed aluminosilicate-framework charge,2Na+/Ca2+ exchange, finite capacity, Mg2+competition and conditional concentrated-Na+ reverse exchange; charge remains fixed and regeneration transfers Ca rather than destroying it. Exact selected official operator: die Merkmale chemischer Gleichgewichte erläutern: Einstellbarkeit von beiden Seiten Boundary: For general equilibrium sources only the demonstrated reversibility/concentration-effect operator is bound. Zeolite is an authored example, not a newly invented official named duty. No actual regeneration/synthesis, ideal-selectivity guarantee, full MWG calculation or full T/p/dynamic-equilibrium programme. For this source the actual counterion/regeneration cases are the specific evidence; framework ion exchange is not relabelled as Brønsted neutralisation, microbial degradation or a physical experiment.",
