          },
          "rationale": "Whole P explains triglyceride/methanol transesterification and1:3→3:1 stoichiometry and explicitly contrasts free-acid neutralisation, ester hydrolysis and alkaline cleavage. Exact selected official operator: die enzymatische Fettspaltung (Verdauung) und die basenkatalysierte Fettspaltung (Verseifung) beschreiben und deren Bedeutung erläutern Boundary: Only the corresponding production/ester-cleavage component is proposed. No real methanol experiment, no equation of transesterification with hydrolysis, no full mechanistic arrows unless present in whole P.",
